The Reporting Persons specifically disclaim beneficial ownership in the Shares reported herein except to the extent of their pecuniary interest therein.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 6.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Contracts, Arrangements, Understandings or Relationships With Respect to Securities of the Issuer</td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">No material changes from the Schedule 13D filed by the Reporting Persons on April 26, 2017.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 7.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Material to be Filed as Exhibits.</td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Exhibit A - Joint Filing Statement
